tradeloop/runs/2026-05-17_1909_adhoc/30_trade_plan.md:24:RELIANCE remains a watchlist-quality large-cap franchise with Jio/Retail optionality and manageable balance-sheet metrics, but the current swing setup is technically broken and sentiment is cautious. A CNC long should wait for price repair or a confirmed reversal rather than anticipate it.
