tradeloop/runs/2026-05-17_1909_adhoc/11_sentiment.md:15:No bullish trade should be based on Tier-C discussion around Jio IPO optionality. The current sentiment case is not a veto on owning RELIANCE long term, but it is a veto on forcing a new swing entry without technical confirmation.
